          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Last year, we hired 3 buses for the school trip. We had a total of 162 students and teachers who went on that trip and all the buses were full. This year we have 204 students. How many buses will we need? Will all the buses be full?"
            }
